{"id":"froh","lemma":"froh","pos":"adj","rank":484,"glosses":["glad; (momentarily) happy; (momentarily) cheerful","merry","merry; hearty; energetic"],"ipa":"/fʁoː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/De-froh.ogg/De-froh.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"froher","superlative":"am frohsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie werden sehr froh sein.","en":"They will be very glad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566592","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Er wäre froh, das zu hören.","en":"He would be glad to hear that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/259","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"}]},{"text":"Er war sehr froh.","en":"He was very happy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69532","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin froh darüber.","en":"I'm glad of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390633","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"above"}]},{"text":"Warum sollte ich froh sein?","en":"Why would I be happy?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to be"}]}]}